<title>JAPAN: BOJ says sees Jan-Mar M2+CD up 3 to 4 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>BOJ says sees Jan-Mar M2+CD up 3 to 4 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Japan said on Friday it expects Japan's broadly defined money supply average of M2 plus certificates of deposit (CDs) for the January-March period to grow between three and four percent from the same quarter of last year.  </p>
<p>M2+CDs grew a preliminary 3.4 percent in the October-December quarter from a year earlier.</p>
</text>
